  "title": "RTX's Raytheon awarded $1.1 billion U.S. Navy contract to produce AIM-9X Block II missiles",
  "summary": "Award continues program expansion capacity to meet rising domestic and international demandTUCSON, Ariz., June 26, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Raytheon, an RTX (NYSE: RTX) business, was awarded a $1.1 billion contract from the U.S. Navy to produce AIM-9X Block II missiles to bolster U.S. military inventory and meet increased demand from allied nations.Under the contract, Raytheon will produce AIM-9X missiles along with associated hardware and software for U.S. and Foreign Military Sales customers.",
